@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "SGW-C" as SGWC
participant "PGW-U" as PGWU
participant "PGW-C" as PGWC
participant "PCRF" as PCRF

== Usage Monitoring Activation ==
PCRF -> PGWC: Diameter (Gx): Re-Auth-Request (RAR)
PGWC -> PCRF: Diameter (Gx): Re-Auth-Answer (RAA)
PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Modification Request
PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Modification Response

== Usage Threshold Reached ==
PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Report Request
PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Report Response
PGWC -> PCRF: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Request (CCR-U)
note over PCRF: Policy decision based on the accumulated usage
PCRF -> PGWC: Diameter (Gx): Credit-Control-Answer (CCA-U)

== Enforcement of the New Policy ==
PGWC -> PGWU: PFCP: Session Modification Request
PGWU -> PGWC: PFCP: Session Modification Response
PGWC -> SGWC: GTPv2: Update Bearer Request (APN-AMBR)
SGWC -> PGWC: GTPv2: Update Bearer Response
@enduml
